 "DixonFixT2"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "787a0e66-830a-a045-b208-ec9b71b93b83"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonReconstruct",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonReconstruct"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"370ec965-f33f-da41-b2ee-710b3f059938"],
 ". If set to true the R2' is fitted rather then the R2*. This is done by \
fixing the T2 of water and each fat peak to the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonRelaxivity",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonRelaxivity"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"80782074-3dc8-234f-b8a3-01a8738437fd"],
 " values."
}], "Usage",
